'''Ancient Egg: N104''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 20 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]]. [[True Form]] massively increases overall stats, increases cost and gains [[Long Distance]] [[Area Attack|Area Attacks]], Behemoth Slayer and immunity to [[Surge Attack]]s.

